uirements-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#网络和端口","content":"部署前建议在目标服务器上确认端口："},"3321":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#网络和端口","content":"如果端口已被占用，先确认占用进程，再决定是释放端口还是修改 Crest 配置。不要安装完成后再临时换端口，SSO 回调、分享地址和反向代理都可能要跟着改。"},"3322":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"生产环境建议提前准备："},"3323":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"固定域名，例如 `https://bi.example.com`。"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"有效 HTTPS 证书。"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"反向代理或 Ingress。"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"Crest 的允许来源配置。"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-64","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"SSO 回调地址。"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-65","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"如果后续才切换域名，分享链接、SSO 回调和浏览器缓存都可能需要重新检查。"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-66","page_id":"/docs/crest/d