/admin-guide/audit","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#示例外部分享被误传播","content":"示例：外部分享被误传播"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#安全治理建议","content":"安全治理建议"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#典型场景处理","content":"典型场景处理"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","content":"审计日志用于追踪系统中的关键操作。账号安全治理则用于降低误操作、越权访问和共享账号风险。管理员应定期查看审计日志，并把异常操作闭环处理。"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"入口：系统管理 → 审计日志。"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"审计日志页用于回答“谁在什么时候做了什么”。图中重点看筛选条件、操作人、操作类型、资源名称、时间和 IP。排查问题时先缩小时间范围，再叠加用户或资源名称，不建议直接在全量日志中翻找。"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"这张截图适合放在管理员培训中说明审计日志的读法。左侧筛选条件用于缩小范围，列表字段用于确认事实，操作详情用于补充上下文。实际排查时不能只截一张列表图，应同时记录筛选条件、关键日志行和处理结论，避免后续复盘时无法还原。"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"常见筛选方式："},"3541":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"筛选维度"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"适用场景"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/crest/