e/audit-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"修改密码页用于用户自行更新密码。管理员交付账号时，应要求用户首次登录后立即修改；如果账号用于应急管理，应把密码保管、使用审批和修改记录纳入安全流程。"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"截图中可以看到旧密码、新密码和确认密码三个输入项。用户修改密码时，要确认当前登录账号就是本人账号；如果浏览器保存了旧密码，修改后还要重新登录一次，确认新密码可用。共享账号、弱密码和长期不变密码都会增加安全风险，正式环境应尽量改成实名账号和角色授权。"},"3556":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"密码修改建议："},"3557":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"场景"},"3558":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"建议"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"首次登录"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"登录后立即修改初始密码"},"3561":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"管理员交接"},"3562":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"交接完成后修改密码并登记负责人"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#修改密码","content":"疑似泄露"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-g