id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"统一品牌展示和可视化渲染效果"},"3641":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"单点登录"},"3642":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"对接企业身份系统"},"3643":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"审计日志"},"3644":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"追踪关键操作，支撑安全审计"},"3645":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理顺序建议","content":"下面这条顺序适合新环境初始化，也适合接手权限边界不清的旧环境时重新梳理。"},"3646":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理顺序建议","content":"先按岗位设计角色，再把用户加入角色。不应为单个用户临时叠加权限，否则后续难以判断权限来源。"},"3647":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#建立组织和用户","content":"先在用户管理中维护组织，再创建实名用户。不要长期使用共享账号或临时账号承载正式资源。"},"3648":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#设计角色","content":"按岗位建立角色，例如平台管理员、数据管理员、分析开发者、业务查看者、外部访客。"},"3649":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#配置菜单和资源权限","content":"先给角色配置菜单，再给具体资源授权。资源权限不要默认全部开放。"},"3650":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#用普通账号验收","content":"创建一个普通测试账号，验证可见菜单、不可见菜单、导出和分享权限。"},"3651":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#接入-sso-和审计","content":"权限模型稳定后，再接入 SSO。接入后检查审计日志是否能记录登录、权限和资源操作。"},"3652":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"用户管理用于创建账号、维护组织、启停用户和调整角色。新用户入职、项目成员变更、离职回收权限，都从这里处理。"},"3653":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"角色管理用于把岗位职责整理成可复用权限集合。角色越清晰，后续权限审计越容易；角色越临时，越容易出现权限扩大。"},"3654":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"权限管理用于控制菜单、功能和资源访问。配置完成后必须用普通账号登录验证，不能只用管理员视角确认。"},"3655":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"频率"},"3656":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"检查项"},"3657":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每日"},"3658":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"异常登录、导出失败、关键资源变更"},"3659":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每周"},"3660":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"新增账号、离职账号、分享链接、默认密码使用情况"},"3661":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每月"},"3662":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-47","page_id":"/docs/cres