响登录、查询、导出、分享或后台任务。修改前先记录原值和原因；修改后不能只确认保存成功，还要做一次登录、数据预览、仪表盘打开和导出检查。"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"截图中的系统参数页更适合由少数管理员维护，不建议开放给普通分析人员。参数修改属于平台变更，影响范围往往比页面上看到的更大。例如查询超时、导出限制、分享地址、任务配置这类参数，可能同时影响数据源预览、数据集缓存、仪表盘访问和导出中心。"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"管理员修改参数时要注意："},"3915":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"项目"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"建议"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"修改前"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"记录原值和修改原因"},"3919":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"修改中"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"一次只改必要参数，避免多个问题叠加"},"3921":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text