de/system-site-font-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"登录页名称是否规范。"},"3931":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"浏览器标题是否符合项目要求。"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"Logo 是否清晰。"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"页面底部或版权信息是否符合企业规范。"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"分享页面是否也展示正确。"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"入口：系统管理 → 字体管理。"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理页影响仪表盘、大屏和导出效果。上传字体后，不能说明所有页面会自动使用该字体；需要在对应仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择并保存。对外项目还要确认字体授权范围。"},"3937":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理常用于数据大屏交付。上传字体前应确认授权范围，尤其是对外展示、商用项目和客户交付环境。"},"3938":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体上传后建议用一张正式大屏做验证，而不是只看字体列表是否出现。因为字体真正生效的位置在编辑器和渲染结果中，特别是中文标题、数字指标、导出图片和投屏环境。对外项目要避免使用没有授权的商业字体。"},"3939":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"操作流程："},"3940":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#准备字体","content":"确认字体文件来源、授权范围和格式。"},"3941":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#上传字体","content":"在字体管理页面上传字体文件，名称保持简洁可识别。"},"3942":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#应用到资源","content":"在仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择字体，保存并预览。"},"3943":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#导出验证","content":"使用图片、PDF 或预览功能检查字体是否生效。"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"场景"},"3945":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建议"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"客户交付"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"统一 Logo、标题、字体和版权"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"多环境部署"},"3949":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"测试、预发、生产保持配置差异可追踪"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"字体过多"},"3951":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"清理未使用字体，避免编辑器选择混乱"},"3952":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"参数变更频繁"},"3953":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建立配置变更审批和记录"},"3954":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"页面展示异常"},"3955":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"先排查站点配置、字体资源和浏览器缓存"},"3956":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"登录页截图是否符合项目形象。"},"3957":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"工作台名称和 Logo 是否正确。"},"3958":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"仪表盘和大屏是否使用统一字体。"},"3959":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"分享页面是否有正确品牌信息。"},"3960":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"导出文件是否能正确显示字体。"},"3961":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"交付验收建议保留截图：登录页、工作台、一个仪表盘预览、一个大屏预览、一个导出文件。这样后续客户或业务方反馈品牌展示问题时，可以快速对比变更前后效果。"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"建议把站点配置变更写入交付清单，至少包含修改人、修改时间、旧值、新值和验收截图。这样后续升级、迁移或重装时，可以快速恢复一致的品牌展示。"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"page","content":"用户与组织","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","管理员指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"Crest 用户管理、组织管理、账号生命周期和账号安全操作说明。"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/a