是先拖入事实表，再拖入维表，最后配置关联字段和关联方式。下面以“订单明细 + 门店维表”为例说明：订单明细负责金额和数量，门店维表负责区域、城市、门店等级等属性。"},"5851":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-172","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"截图左上角的“单源/跨源”用于决定数据集是否可以选择多个数据源。单源适合大多数场景，性能和维护成本更可控；跨源适合多个系统之间做轻量关联。跨源建模前，先确认两个数据源的刷新时间、字段口径和数据量都能接受。"},"5852":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-173","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"跨源并不是“能关联就应该关联”。如果数据量大、刷新频率高，建议先在数仓或数据库中加工成统一视图；如果只是把少量目标值、映射表或字典表补到主数据里，跨源会比较合适。"},"5853":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-174","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"配置前先确认："},"5854":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-175","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"项目"},"5855":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-176","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"要确认什么"},"5856":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-177","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"主表"},"5857":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-178","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"哪张表代表分析粒度，例如订单、工单、项目、流水"},"5858":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-179","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"关联表"},"5859":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-180","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"哪张表补充属性，例如客户、门店、组织、区域"},"5860":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-181","page_id":"/docs/c