22","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量配置步骤："},"6002":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-323","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择增量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“增量”。系统会尝试识别可用的增量字段。"},"6003":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-324","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#确认增量字段","content":"展开“更多设置”，选择自增 ID、更新时间或其他可靠水位字段。不要仅因为字段排在第一个就直接使用。"},"6004":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-325","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置全量刷新间隔","content":"增量任务建议保留周期性全量校准，例如每 24 小时做一次全量刷新，用来修正遗漏、补录和水位异常。"},"6005":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-326","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置超时时间","content":"根据数据量设置合理超时。任务经常超时，通常说明数据范围太大、SQL 太慢或源库连接不稳定。"},"6006":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-327","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#开启更新后校验","content":"勾选“更新后校验”。任务完成后对比源端和缓存端的行数或水位，便于发现缓存异常。"},"6007":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-328","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#执行一次并查看状态","content":"点击“立即更新”，确认行数、执行时间、缓存状态和校验结果正常。"},"6008":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-329","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时更新用于把数据集刷新节奏固定下来。它不等同于“越频繁越好”，刷新频率要和源数据产生频率、业务使用时间和系统承载能力匹配。"},"6009":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-330","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"数据类型"},"6010":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-331","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例频率"},"6011":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-332","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"说明"},"6012":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-333","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"经营日报、月报"},"6013":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-334","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"每天 1 次"},"6014":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-335","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"通常安排在数据仓库完成后"},"6015":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-336","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"项目交付、需求流转"},"6016":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-337","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"每 30 分钟或每小时"},"6017":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-338","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"适合会议和日常运营看板"},"6018":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-339","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"告警、值班监控"},"6019":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-340","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"5 到 15 分钟"},"6020":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-341","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"需要确认源库和查询引擎能承受"},"6021":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-342","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":