ide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#先认识页面","content":"选中一个数据源后，右侧会展示连接信息和维护动作。这里适合做日常检查：确认连接类型、最近更新时间、负责人和下游使用情况。"},"6135":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#先认识页面","content":"详情页重点看三处：第一是数据源名称和类型，确认没有选错环境；第二是连接状态和最近更新时间，判断连接是否仍可用；第三是下方表、字段和预览入口，保存后必须从这里验证数据源不是“只保存成功但不可查询”。"},"6136":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#先认识页面","content":"生产库建议使用只读账号，不要使用 root、DBA 或业务系统写入账号。公开文档、培训截图和工单中不要出现真实密码、Token、内网地址和个人账号。"},"6137":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"Crest 支持常见数据库、分析型数据库、文件和接口数据源。创建前先确认数据的来源类型，再选择对应入口。"},"6138":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"分类"},"6139":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"支持类型"},"6140":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"常见场景"},"6141":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"关系型数据库"},"6142":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#支持的数据源类型","content":"MySQL、MariaDB、PostgreSQL、SQL Server、Oracle、Db2、TiDB、OceanBase Oracle"},"6143":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/data