est/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"平台研发部"},"6219":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-130","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"120"},"6220":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-131","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"0.92"},"6221":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-132","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"2026-05"},"6222":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-133","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"数据产品部"},"6223":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-134","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"80"},"6224":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-135","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"0.9"},"6225":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-136","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"标题不应拆成两行，表格上方也不应放置“填报说明”。这些说明可以写进数据源备注或文档里，不要混入文件数据行。"},"6226":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-137","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"上传前先整理文件："},"6227":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-138","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"第一行必须是字段名。"},"6228":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-139","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"字段名不要重复，不要包含空白列。"},"6229":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-140","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"不使用合并单元格。"},"6230":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-141","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"日期列格式统一。"},"6231":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-142","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"数值列不要混入单位文字，例如“万元”“约 100”。"},"6232":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-143","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"删除空行、说明行、汇总行和隐藏列。"},"6233":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-144","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"文件名和数据源名称要能表达业务含义。"},"6234":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-145","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"文件保存后，Crest 会把表头识别为字段。后续如果替换文件，字段名和字段类型要尽量保持一致，否则下游数据集和图表可能需要重新配置。"},"6235":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-146","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 数据源用于读取外部接口。它适合无法直接开放数据库、只提供服务接口的系统。配置 API 前，需要拿到接口文档，并确认鉴权、分页和返回结构。"},"6236":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-147","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 表单先配置接口级信息，例如请求地址、请求方式、鉴权和公共参数。这里建议使用系统服务账号，不使用个人 Token；接口有过期时间或频率限制时，要在数据源说明里写清楚，方便后续维护。"},"6237":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-148","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"填写 API 表单时，先用接口调试工具确认接口能返回数据，再回到 Crest 配置。Crest 里保存的不是“接口文档”，而是一个能被数据集读取的数据入口。请求方式、Header、Body、分页和超时只要有一项不对，后续数据集就可能空白或只读到第一页。"},"6238":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-149","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"创建 API 数据源后，需要在数据源内添加 API 表。每个 API 表可以理解为一个可被数据集使用的接口结果。"},"6239":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"添加 API 表时，重点是把接口返回结果整理成“表”。如果接口返回的是嵌套 JSON，要明确取哪一层作为数据行、哪些字段作为列。保存前使用测试请求检查返回结果，不应只凭接口文档配置。"},"6240":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"例如接口返回："},"6241":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"这时通常要把 `data.records` 作为数据行，把 `project`、`stage`、`count` 作为字段。不应把整个 `data` 对象作为一个字段，否则图表只能看到一段 JSON 文本，无法按项目或阶段统计。"},"6242":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"当前版本已包含 API 数据源 JsonPath 解析修复。启用 JsonPath 后，系统会按指定节点解析行数据，而不是继续按完整响应推断结构。例如接口返回数据在 `$data.dataList` 下时，应把该路径配置为数据行位置，再从子节点中选择字段。启用 JsonPath 后，字段选择仍保持可编辑，便于补充字段名称、类型和业务说明。"},"6243":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"常见 JsonPath 配置示例："},"6244":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"返回结构"},"6245":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-156","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"行数据路径"},"6246":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-157","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"字段配置"},"6247":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-158","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`{ \"data\": { \"dataList\": [ ... ] } }`"},"6248":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-159","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`$data.dataList`"},"6249":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-160","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"从 `dataList` 子节点中选择字段"},"6250":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-161","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`{ \"records\": [ ... ] }`"},"6251":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-162","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`$records`"},"6252":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-163","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"从 `records` 数组元素中选择字段"},"6253":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-164","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`[ { ... } ]`"},"6254":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-165","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"`$`"},"6255":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-166","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"直接按数组元素解析字段"},"6256":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-167","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 请求头中建议使用标准 `Authorization` 项承载 Token、Bearer Token 或 Basic Auth。不要把长期个人 Token 写入公开文档、截图或培训材料。"},"6257":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-168","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"API 配置重点："},"6258":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-169","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"配置项"},"6259":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-170","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"说明"},"6260":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-171","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"检查方式"},"6261":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-172","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"请求地址"},"6262":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-173","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"完整接口 URL，包含协议、域名和路径"},"6263":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-174","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content"