"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"数据源保存后，进入表管理区域检查库表是否完整。列表中通常可以看到表名、类型、注释等信息。"},"6284":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-195","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表列表用于确认 Crest 能看到哪些表或视图。正式项目建议优先使用业务视图或数仓宽表，减少直接读取原始业务表。看到表名后不要立刻拿去做图表，先打开表预览检查字段和样例数据。"},"6285":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-196","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"打开目标表后，先检查字段，再做数据预览。"},"6286":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-197","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表预览用于做第一轮数据验收。预览阶段至少要检查字段类型、日期格式、金额单位、空值、乱码和样例行。如果源数据在预览阶段已经异常，后续数据集、图表和大屏都会受到影响。"},"6287":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-198","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"保存后至少检查这些内容："},"6288":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-199","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"目标表或视图是否能看到。"},"6289":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-200","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"字段名称、字段类型和注释是否完整。"},"6290":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-201","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"日期、金额、数量等关键字段是否识别正确。"},"6291":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-202","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"数据预览是否能返回结果。"},"6292":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-203","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/c