t/user-guide/screen-236","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表可按配置导出带格式 Excel"},"7222":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-237","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置步骤："},"7223":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-238","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先配置表格","content":"先把明细表或汇总表放到画布中，完成数据集、字段、排序、表头说明和权限检查。"},"7224":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-239","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加导出按钮","content":"在组件面板中添加导出按钮，将按钮放在表格附近或页面操作区。"},"7225":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-240","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定目标表格","content":"在按钮配置中选择要导出的表格组件。目标表格应是用户当前能看懂、能核对的数据。"},"7226":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-241","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#选择导出范围","content":"需要按页面查询组件、联动和外部参数导出时，选择当前筛选结果。需要导出完整数据时，确认权限和数据量后再选择全部数据。"},"7227":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-242","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"发布前进入预览页，设置筛选条件后点击导出按钮，确认导出中心生成任务，下载后核对字段、表头和数据范围。"},"7228":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-243","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"导出按钮不是简单截图下载。表格视图导出会结合当前筛选、联动、外部参数、Web 参数和钻取上下文生成 Excel。正式大屏中建议把导出按钮放在明细表附近，并用清晰文案说明导出范围。"},"7229":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-244","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#实战做出示例里的关键组件","content":"内置大屏里有几类组件适合复用：累积流图、阶段漏斗、投入产出矩阵、明细表、趋势图和时效排行。下面按“组件效果、示例字段、编辑器配置”说明。示例字段只用于演示配置思路，正式页面应替换为企业自己的需求、项目、人员、质量或经营字段。"},"7230":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-245","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"这张图用于看需求在不同阶段的堆积情况。面积越厚，说明该阶段积压越多；整体上升，说明需求池总量在增长；某个颜色持续变厚，通常代表该阶段成为瓶颈。"},"7231":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-246","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"演示示例配置："},"7232":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-247","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"配置项"},"7233":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-248","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7234":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-249","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"图表类型"},"7235":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-250","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"累积流图"},"7236":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"数据集"},"7237":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段每日快照类数据集"},"7238":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"X 轴"},"7239":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"日期 `stat_date`"},"7240":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/doc