":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"7251":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"7252":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"7253":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"7254":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求数"},"7255":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"7256":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"7257":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"42"},"7258":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"7259":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"开发中"},"7260":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"18"},"7261":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/sc