-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"创建步骤："},"7283":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备阶段统计数据","content":"每个阶段一行，至少包含阶段名称、需求数、平均耗时、P90 耗时和超期数。阶段名称要提前排好业务顺序。"},"7284":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加阶段漏斗","content":"在“图表”中选择阶段周期漏斗或漏斗类组件。把组件放在累积流图旁边，适合做右侧解释区。"},"7285":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置阶段和数值","content":"把“阶段”放入分类字段，把“需求数”放入数值字段。若组件支持扩展指标，再补充平均耗时、P90 和超期数。"},"7286":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置颜色","content":"阶段颜色建议和累积流图一致。用户看到同一种颜色时，能自然联想到同一个阶段。"},"7287":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"标签要显示阶段名和关键数值。示例中的写法是“数、均、P90、超”，信息密度高，但仍能读懂。"},"7288":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"使用提醒：漏斗的重点不是视觉宽度，而是清晰呈现阶段差异。阶段太多时，优先保留主流程阶段，把过细状态归并。"},"7289":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段周期漏斗的字段可以从需求流转记录中计算出来。示例结构如下："},"7290":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段"},"7291":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"需求数"},"7292":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/scree