d":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"这张图用于比较各阶段平均耗时和 P90 耗时。P90 比平均值更能暴露长尾问题。"},"7388":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-403","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置方式："},"7389":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-404","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置项"},"7390":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-405","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7391":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-406","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"图表类型"},"7392":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-407","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"横向条形图"},"7393":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-408","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"分类"},"7394":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-409","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"7395":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-410","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"指标"},"7396":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-411","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"平均耗时 `avg_days`、P90 耗时 `p90_days`"},"7397":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-412","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"创建时