:"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#观察启动日志","content":"重点关注数据库迁移、连接池、后台任务和错误日志。"},"8369":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#完成功能验证","content":"按上线检查清单验证登录、权限、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出。"},"8370":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"验证通过后通知用户恢复使用，并保留升级观察窗口。"},"8371":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级过程中不要同时做无关配置变更。例如不要一边升级版本，一边改域名、SSO、数据库密码、加密模式或权限模型。多个变更叠加会让问题定位变得困难。"},"8372":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"从旧版本升级到 v1.5.10 时，如果不需要国密能力，继续保持 `CREST_CRYPTO_MODE=standard` 即可；用户操作流程不需要调整。如果项目需要启用 `sm-suite`，应先在测试环境验证密钥、登录、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享、导出和 SSO，再安排生产维护窗口。"},"8373":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.10 的升级路径需要按来源版本区分："},"8374":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"来源版本"},"8375":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级动作"},"8376":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.8"},"8377":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"备份后替换 `crest-service:v1.5.10` 和 `crest-web:v1.5.10`，不需要执行新增升级 SQL"},"8378":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.7"},"8379":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"先备份元数据库和运行目录，执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"8380":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.6"},"8381":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"8382":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.5"},"8383":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"8384":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.4"},"8385":{"id":"/docs/crest/main